  m_text: Nyeh heh heh, adventurer.  I am the witch, who will teach you how to tend to the soil.  What, you thought I was going to make potions for you?  Get out of here with your stereotyping.  And bring back five fully grown radishes.  As proof, definitely not for my radish jam.
